<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine shuts Chernobyl reactor as planned.</title>
<headline>Ukraine shuts Chernobyl reactor as planned.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine closed one of the two working reactors at the Chernobyl nuclear power plant as planned on Saturday, the station's director said.</p>
<p>&quot;Everything went to schedule. Reactor number one was shut down at 10 p.m. (2000 GMT),&quot; Sergei Parashin said by telephone from the Chernobyl plant, scene of the world's worst nuclear accident in 1986.</p>
</text>
